    "chunk_text": "s of sancta Marian acenned. Of Iordane, \u00fee ure Drihten w\u00e6s on gefullod. Of \u00feam spere, \u00fee ures Drihtenes halige syd w\u00e6s mid geopenod on \u00fe\u00e6re rode. Of \u00feam beode, \u00fee se H\u00e6lend onuppan hine gereordode mid his twelf apostolum. Of \u00fe\u00e6re dune Synay, \u00fe\u00e6r\u00f0\u00e6r God anuppan atiwde \u00feam halgan Moyse & him \u00f0\u00e6r \u00fea ealdan \u00e6 Of \u00feam \u00feorn\u00feifele, \u00fee wundorlice barn & \u00feeah ungewemmed w\u00e6s fram \u00e6lcere b\u00e6rninge, \u00fea\u00f0a God silf Of \u00fe\u00e6re dune, \u00fee ure Drihten onuppan f\u00e6ste. Of \u00fe\u00e6re candele, \u00f0e Godes engel ontende mid heofenlicum leohte \u00e6t ures Drihtenes sepulchre on Of \u00feam altare, \u00fee ure Drihten silf gehalgode. Of \u00fe\u00e6re stowwe, \u00fee ure Drihten w\u00e6s on geeacnod. Of Oliuetes dune, uppan \u00fe\u00e6re se H\u00e6lend hine geb\u00e6d gebigedum cneowwum to his heofenlican F\u00e6der, Of \u00feam girlan \u00fe\u00e6re heofenlican hl\u00e6fdian sancta Marian. Of \u00feam heafodcla\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan Godes modor & of hire fexe. Of sumere halignisse, \u00fee se heahengel Michahel on eor\u00fean geswutelode. Of sanctus Iohannes lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s fulluhteres & of his gew\u00e6dum. Of sanctus Petrus apostoles berde. Of sanctus Petres fexe. Of sanctus Petrus girlan. Of sanctus Paules apostoles swurbane & of his cla\u00f0on. Of sanctus Andreas stafe \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles. Of sanctus Iohannes cla\u00f0on \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles & godspelleres, \u00fee ure",
